{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgjwVVGvgo7oMcQptpKoh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've looked at the screens I said were unchecked, fixed the problems I found and rebuilt. The fast suite and phone checks pass, but I have not re-run the full playthrough after these last edits.\n\n- **Looked at at 1920×1080:** Case Files, the Grand Rounds lobby, About and Results. The Case Files folder and the lobby seats look fine.\n- **Fixed:** the DEV tag on the results screen no longer overlaps the \"CASE CLOSED\" title. About now shows 6 Source Information rows per page instead of 4, so the Source Information text can be read in-game.\n- **Not looked at:** the difficulty screen and the Lost screen. I took a difficulty screenshot but didn't open it, and I never took one of Lost.\n- **Ship's ward:** Chapter 3 now uses a ship variant of the ward with a swinging lamp, rain and a rolling light, under a \"SHIP'S WARD\" title. It is the same map as Ward 3, not a separate one.\n- **Cinematic:** the gurney rush now includes a rigged character running beside the gurney. The other four cinematics (gala, storm, final table, ER) are still painted shapes with no rigs. The rig in the gurney scene draws small.\n- **Ward rigs:** the nurse, Percy, Odalys and the bed patients no longer carry the engine's default sword.\n- **Not re-verified in this pass:** the fast suite (605 checks) and the phone checks (10) pass on the rebuilt HTML. The Hub harness and the Chromium, Firefox and WebKit checks ran on the earlier build, not on these last edits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":575,"cache_read_input_tokens":496739,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":575},"output_tokens":540,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnost