{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgjxu8fivUpjaVLEemxoN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the four gaps are closed. The cinematics and the ship's ward are still simplified.\n\n**Closed this pass**\n- **Dev panel:** the slider values now sit to the right of the bars with clear spacing. I checked this in a 1920×1080 screenshot.\n- **2560×1440:** I viewed an operation frame at that size. The HUD is inside the screen and the cavity is centered.\n\n**Verified on the final build** (rebuilt after the dev-panel edit)\n- The fast node suite passes (605 checks, 0 failed).\n- The 2-player Hub harness run passes (32 checks, 0 failed).\n- The Chromium checks pass (15 checks, 0 failed).\n- Not re-run after that last edit: the full playthrough, the other three Hub runs, Firefox/WebKit and the phone checks. Their last runs were on the build before it. The edit only touched the dev panel's slider layout.\n\n**Screens viewed at 1920×1080:** every screen in the game has now been looked at, with a few exceptions:\n- Credits, Settings, the Hub card and the ER ending were each checked in a single screenshot.\n- I only saw a 3440×1440 operation frame, not other screens at that size.\n\n**Gaps I did not close**\n- **Cinematics:** all five are short scenes with rigged characters over painted stages and a few painted props. PLAN.md describes fuller rig-driven cinematics, and those are not built.\n- **Ship's ward:** it is its own compact map, but it reuses Ward 3's props. PLAN.md calls for its own props.\n- **Playthrough, harness and browser runs:** the full playthrough and the other Hub and browser runs were not repeated after the final dev-panel change.\n\nAll three deliverables are in the work folder: the single `SuturesAndSorrows-TraumaCenterSecondOpinion-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261105-062952.html`, `exit-interview.json`, and the dev folder."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":299,"cache_read_input_tokens":602272,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":299},"output_tokens":655,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73cf9888-9422-42e0-82aa-d7becfd7d585","uuid":"ea17c45f-f957-4f23-9dc7-37d274c30317","timestamp":"2026-11-05T14:47:58.238Z","request_id":"req_011Cgjxu8Gf4vy9WsauE9zH2"}
